                                "sense_id": "5e0ee1a9-3273-3cf7-a247-eaef0881e676",
                                "text": "I inquired of one prominent Earthian: \"What's of constructing ships and buildings...?\""
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "9bf8cdbe-409e-43d7-92ee-0500ef2a9095",
                                "sense_id": "5e0ee1a9-3273-3cf7-a247-eaef0881e676",
                                "text": "I most likely will be the second Earthian to reach that planet. ..."
                            }
                        ]
